{"asset_key":"ep8/quest_story_18206010","episode":"ep8","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18206010","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1820601001:0":{"text":"不省心的孩子们，又有何事？老身现在可没空和你们耍嘴皮子。","source_cn":"不省心的孩子们，又有何事？老身现在可没空和你们耍嘴皮子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6CA85BA9B094AD76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1820601002:0":{"text":"我和<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>是来帮你的。至少在保护夕染村、对抗班题斯这件事上，我们目的一致。","source_cn":"我和<style=stress><player_nam...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4CCE374811A955DC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"我和<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>是来帮你的。至少在保护夕染村、对抗班题斯这件事上，我们目的一致。","female":"我和<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>是来帮你的。至少在保护夕染村、对抗班题斯这件事上，我们目的一致。","variant_male_record_index":"245268","variant_female_record_index":"245269","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1820601003:0":{"text":"还算你识相，生者小子。","source_cn":"还算你识相，生者小子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD13B0DC8F5EF0BF5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1820601004:0":{"text":"既然如此，老身也不必客气了。去搜罗些<style=\"highlight\">熟过头的胎珠椒</style>，再钓一条<style=\"highlight\">瘦弱的咒怨灵</style>回来。","source_cn":"既然如此，老身也不必客气了。去搜罗些<style=hi...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDFCF94A60C49165A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1820601005:0":{"text":